[h1]Speculative Markets - Morgenroete Compatibility[/h1]
Adds Morgenroete's instruments, uranium and publications to speculation, banking and the Finance panel. Air travel and orchestral music aren't included.

[h2]Load order[/h2]
[list]
[*][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3385002128]Community Mod Framework[/url]
[*][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2889925770]Morgenroete[/url]
[*][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3831434383]Speculative Markets[/url]
[*]This patch
[*][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3839275348]CMF compatibility patch[/url]
[/list]
[b]Disable the old Speculative Markets+Morgenroete patch.[/b] Keep a backup of your save when switching.

Made for Speculative Markets 1.3 (or Beta 1.3.0-beta.1), Morgenroete 2.9.1c and Victoria 3 1.15.

For bug reports, include your versions, load order and error log.

[h2]Credits[/h2]
Morgenroete's goods, buildings and artwork are made by its authors.

[h2]Latest update[/h2]
[b]1.3.0[/b]
[list]
[*]Rebuilt for Speculative Markets 1.3. Contests from 0 to 100, Sound Credit, the construction effects of booms, panics and Bad Debts, and their text now work with Morgenroete.
[/list]

[h2]Previous updates[/h2]
[b]1.2.1[/b]
[list]
[*]Rebuilt for Speculative Markets 1.2.1, so the new leverage bonus, Bad Debts and their text work with Morgenroete. The 1.2.0 patch kept 1.2.0's values and text.
[/list]

[b]1.2.0[/b]
[list]
[*]Rebuilt for Speculative Markets 1.2.0: interest group goods stances, the Monetary Standard, Financial Integration and the new Finance views now work with Morgenroete.
[/list]

[b]1.1.0[/b]
[list]
[*]Rebuilt for Speculative Markets 1.1.2. The 1.0.0 patch replaced 1.1's Finance window, monthly logic and text with 1.0.5 versions.
[*]Competing Exchanges, Blue Chips, the new Paths to Renown and all 1.1 translations now work with Morgenroete.
[/list]
